Specification Calculator 

Calculation Add_two_numbers
Description adds number1 to number2 giving result 
Examples:  Adder
| number1 | number2 | result |
| 2       | 3       | 5      |
| 10      | 20      | 30     |
| -1      | 1       | 0      |
	  
Attributes Adder
| Name    | Default | Datatype |
| number1 | 0       | Integer  |
| number2 | 0       | Integer  |
| result  | 0       | Integer  |

	  
